0e7a mant\u00eam os principais componentes qu\u00edmicos separados at\u00e9 o momento da fric\u00e7\u00e3o, enquanto o fecho de um alfinete de seguran\u00e7a cobre sua ponta afiada.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5627-7541-ac44-e5b60e7dc2e8","description":"Seguran\u00e7a","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-75d6-90e8-79ce12f8ef34","description":"Afiado","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-7c0c-8815-2d238b3c0400","description":"Liso","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-71cd-b5be-7cfb09f5e658","description":"Brilhante","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-7819-833f-f8cb87cc2778","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a esp\u00e9cie de \u00e1rvore mais alta do mundo?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"As sequoias-costeiras podem atingir mais de 100 metros de altura. As sequoias gigantes s\u00e3o geralmente mais baixas, embora sejam muito mais volumosas.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5627-7d6b-ae01-0f81ee27a74f","description":"Sequoia costeira","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-7329-9736-bf85cf7b77b7","description":"Fresno","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-71d7-91cc-87a35a9614a3","description":"Carvalho","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-7d34-ac3a-e94fd69ce3e5","description":"Abeto-de-Douglas","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-75f7-a43a-4c2e94178fb7","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual peixe \u00e9 capaz de respirar ar?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Os peixes pulmonados possuem \u00f3rg\u00e3os para respirar ar, e alguns conseguem sobreviver \u00e0 seca enterrados na lama dentro de um casulo de muco.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5627-7ba1-9cd0-ae0a3ad4f1df","description":"Peixe-pulm\u00e3o","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-7d14-ac80-2eaff39c5451","description":"Tubar\u00e3o","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-734e-825f-f6ee91eac881","description":"Peixe-do-ar","corre