ologistas s\u00e3o m\u00e9dicos que podem realizar cirurgias para tratar doen\u00e7as que afetam os olhos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5627-7864-97a5-43e75210d196","description":"Olhos","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-7384-8817-3c04bae71ff0","description":"Test\u00edculos","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-7e15-8665-0402539d3064","description":"Rins","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-7041-b760-3967dac2b6e4","description":"P\u00e9s","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-72a3-af9f-0a6f067b51e5","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quantos lados tem um hept\u00e1gono?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"O prefixo \u201chepta-\u201d vem do grego e significa \u201csete\u201d; ele tamb\u00e9m aparece na palavra \u201cheptatlo\u201d, uma prova que inclui sete disciplinas.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5627-72ce-beec-6a98022a6af1","description":"7","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-7acc-8164-4a7f57b4e12f","description":"8","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-73c5-a752-f501ef5ef372","description":"6","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-7b75-89fe-1dbaab56605c","description":"9","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-71e7-bb60-c27b2de6584d","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a hierologia estuda?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"A hierologia trata, de maneira geral, de assuntos sagrados, enquanto a teologia se concentra mais especificamente em Deus e na doutrina religiosa.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5627-7e19-b87a-38c346cbbf96","description":"um termo mais abrangente para teologia","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-79b7-a12c-c576763058a1","description":"a hist\u00f3ria, l\u00ednguas e culturas do subcontinente indiano","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-7d94-ab41-5f29880ed924","description":"os sum\u00e9rios","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5627-7070-9fc9-2432c697cdd3","descrip