os mam\u00edferos, qual \u00f3rg\u00e3o produz leite?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"As gl\u00e2ndulas mam\u00e1rias s\u00e3o gl\u00e2ndulas sudor\u00edparas modificadas, e a prolactina ajuda a estimular a produ\u00e7\u00e3o de leite ap\u00f3s o parto.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5628-7b87-b793-74d989f797b0","description":"Gl\u00e2ndula mam\u00e1ria","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5628-724a-92ba-8115929ca0b0","description":"Pr\u00f3stata","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5628-781e-906d-fb46f3176451","description":"P\u00e2ncreas","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5628-7374-bc34-2928d98a5466","description":"Gl\u00e2ndula pituit\u00e1ria","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5628-77ec-8bf7-d6af38abe819","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quais organismos usam br\u00e2nquias para respirar?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Muitos moluscos aqu\u00e1ticos, incluindo mariscos e lulas, respiram por meio de br\u00e2nquias, enquanto alguns esp\u00e9cies terrestres respiram com pulm\u00f5es.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5628-7cc4-89b6-5be62aeb03a9","description":"Moluscos","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5628-789a-ad47-93f8b98f56ff","description":"Pinguins","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5628-72f8-81d0-55e5238fb4e3","description":"Bact\u00e9rias","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5628-7e6d-b8c3-7646cea693ae","description":"Manguezais","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5628-79eb-8715-bee88bff884c","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual sistema de contagem utiliza os n\u00fameros de 0 a 9 e as letras de a a f?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"O hexadecimal \u00e9 de base 16; os c\u00f3digos de cores de computadores costumam utiliz\u00e1-lo, com valores como #FFFFFF representando o branco.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5628-7aa2-941b-e8e7003b0ce2","description":"Hexadecimal","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5628-7e89-b471-478e